This demonstrates a long text paragraph.

Automatic wrapping

When the text reaches the edge of the screen, Flutter automatically moves the remaining text to the next line.

TextAlign.justify
textAlign: TextAlign.justify,

Attempts to align the paragraph evenly along both the left and right edges.

18. SizedBox

You have several:

