Important Text widget properties
Property	Purpose	Example
fontSize	Changes text size	fontSize: 24
fontWeight	Makes text bold	FontWeight.bold
fontStyle	Makes text italic	FontStyle.italic
color	Changes text color	Colors.red
decoration	Adds underline	TextDecoration.underline
textAlign	Aligns text	TextAlign.center
TextAlign.justify	Justifies paragraph	TextAlign.justify
